{"title":"2017 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the diagram, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/f/89fff82bb65d0215e49c8c91cb7c553da52205e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/6/9a65c05bd85d2609bea5db2b109ed5f556463511.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AE$\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" /> intersect at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/7/fb71d5ba363a314c0343efdd9a19aafe8070c75e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = BC$\" width=\"81\" height=\"13\" />. Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/a/fea8b5d4612f036a40dd79d26d3416afd8315735.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABC = 40^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"107\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/f/b6f01ff49cf133813e9c04927654b48ade188fc2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle DCE = x^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"101\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/f/89fff82bb65d0215e49c8c91cb7c553da52205e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/6/9a65c05bd85d2609bea5db2b109ed5f556463511.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AE$\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" /> are straight lines, meaning that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/8/ca891323c7bbfe20cb23953d55a029fc1df88836.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle DCE$\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/2/0728bebb477a2636300c56851b6a6f9e382c1b83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ACB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"14\" /> have the same measure, so the measures of those angles are both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/9/da9bb652e84532a7cddad7b633cb769bc6946d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{\\circ}$\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/7/fb71d5ba363a314c0343efdd9a19aafe8070c75e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = BC$\" width=\"81\" height=\"13\" /> in triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/3/21361fc8f29984fa3e95bfc0e578efdbce08c736.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ACB$\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />, the measures of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/2/0728bebb477a2636300c56851b6a6f9e382c1b83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ACB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/9/d39a4406ab9a6a9f1d35009c2e18008d1888fc4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle CAB$\" width=\"54\" height=\"13\" /> are equal, so they are both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/9/da9bb652e84532a7cddad7b633cb769bc6946d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{\\circ}$\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" /> as well. The sum of the measures of the interior angles in a triangle is always <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/0/3f0cd95f95238159d02dbcea0aca632c2928991c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"37\" height=\"15\" />, so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/e/eee40d504a2f83fd7c94cb005495045f5e611902.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + x + 40 = 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"137\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/3/0e3d1b30f8368e29a7d20e5f3a08da979d66e4d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x = 180 - 40 = 140$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"165\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/1/c419c5317c288c5e290a46755e223c54b2f70601.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{140}{2} = \\boxed{70}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"121\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CIMC\" title=\"2017 CIMC\">2017 CIMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CIMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CIMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CIMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CIMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part A Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5\" title=\"2017 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 5\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2\" title=\"2017 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Intermediate_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Intermediate Competition\">CEMC Intermediate Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017123615\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.025 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 139/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1656/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 143/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3530/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   21.719      1 -total\n 53.97%   11.721      1 Template:CEMC_CIMC/CSMC_box\n 35.81%    7.777      1 Template:Image_needed\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37148:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017123615 and revision id 286997. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}